<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Define a link.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Define linking number.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Define the knot group.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>What is a Seifert surface?</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
